# Public (no bad.ass extras) variant — composed on top of
# x3000/config.common by prepare.sh. Strips anything that only makes
# sense inside the bad.ass network so outsiders flashing this image
# don't end up with our CA, our feed-signing key, or a telegraf trying
# to reach metrics.bad.ass.

# Telegraf is private-only — explicit unset to override any defconfig
# pull-in by transitive deps.
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_telegraf is not set
# CONFIG_PACKAGE_telegraf-full is not set
